{"id":"u-41fc6c05-34c5-4ee4-9072-933644e24c98","src":"community","title":"Guray’s Hypertrophy Max","author":"Berkcan","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/6GTEpp-gurays-hypertrophy-max","desc":"A 5-day/week, intermediate-level hypertrophy block using full gym equipment, ~50 min sessions.\n\nThe approach is low volume, high intensity: most exercises are 1–3 sets, but pushed close to or to failure.\n\nThe split hits each muscle group roughly twice per week (e.g., back/arms appear on both Day 2 and Day 5, shoulders on Day 1 and Day 4, legs on Day 3 with follow-up leg work on Day 5), so recovery time between hits is built in.\n\nThe philosophy is to maximize muscle damage/stimulus per exercise rather than accumulate a lot of junk volume. You're meant to feel genuinely spent by the end of each session rather than chasing a pump.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":5,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-29T01:51:16.341Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Friday","Saturday"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Overhead Rope Extension"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Plate Loaded Wide Grip Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Flexion Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Cu